Package: cpv2017
Type: Package
Title: Microdata of the 2017 Population and Housing Census of Peru
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Denis", "Rodriguez", email = "denisyenrc@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Query the microdata of the 2017 National Population and Housing
    Census of Peru ('Censo Nacional de Población y Vivienda 2017'), published
    by the National Institute of Statistics and Informatics ('INEI') in
    'REDATAM' format, using 'dplyr' verbs without loading its 29 million
    person records into memory. Provides a download of the census already
    converted to compressed 'Parquet' files, a native reader for the
    'REDATAM' formats ('.dicX', '.ptr' and 'PCK', 'CHR' and 'DBL' '.rbf'
    files) to convert the original database, the variable dictionary, and
    helpers to recode missing-value codes and to label categories. The
    documentation is in Spanish.
